                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "Very interesting and lovely indie game. This remindered my childhood toy. :p\n\n(This is v0.83 version review)\nFeatures:\n1) Real-time turn based strategy\n2) Cartoon style graphic and interface\n3) Relax type music\n4) Good sound fx and voice acting\n5) Great performance\n6) Great animations\n7) Replayable gameplay\n8) Basic skill and level up\n9) Fast response by developers\n10) More languages support\n11) Still update (This mean will more content coming soon)\n\nPS: I add this to my favourite one. :D\n",
